    "description": {
      "value": "If you put this large opalescent conch shell to your ear, you can hear the sound of the roaring sea crashing against the shore.\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n- **Traits:** auditory\n\nYou can raise the conch to your lips and blow into it, letting out a long, rumbling note. For the next minute, you and all allies who were within 30 feet of you when you activated the conch gain a +2 item bonus to Athletics checks to Swim and can breathe under water."
